# Rain or snow outside (opt-in weather): a red-and-white umbrella over the duck's head. Drawn
# behind the duck, so the handle disappears behind its head and a hat sits in front.
# open-1..3: thrown in the rain, it pops open over its head and puffs up like a parachute, and
# the duck floats down (core/flight.ts FLOAT_FEEL).
